{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1651363200, "end_date": 1652054399, "month_true_total": 545, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:48:55 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "115176483", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001536271", "personaname": "odhan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198001536271/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 7810, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5032, "last_played": 1658770704, "avatar": "19948125924b925a193a12d25e2c0f063810fa27"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game has a lot of potential, I've had some good sessions playing with friends and the odd good game with pubs. I can't recommend it in it's current state as the harder difficulties feel utterly unbalanced; Veteran feels easy and worlds apart from Nightmare which is mostly unplayable. It doesn't help that the card system can make the early maps potentially impossible and the latter maps a breeze in comparison - which is just broken.\n\nHoping to come back and change this thumbs down to a thumbs up if the balancing issues can be fixed.\n\nEdit after another 30 hours game time. The full deck draw has helped to fudge the issue with balancing, but it's still there, the higher difficulties can be ridiculous. They have now added achievements for completing their \"no hope\" difficulty, another FU to the players from the devs. The game is unplayable with pubs, still a thumbs down.", "timestamp_created": 1652044817, "timestamp_updated": 1657561938, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "115164453", "